{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/03/22/5254858/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！さゆにゃんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは、みなさんにお礼を。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/03/22/5254858/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手はおひざ。 ぺこり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は、5ｔｈ全国握手会とチャリティーライヴがありました。\nきてくださったみなさん、来れずとも遠くから応援してくださったみなさん、有難きｼｱﾜｾ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえーい☆"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/03/22/5254858/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終了後、汗だくのみんな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うむ！良き汗をかいたぜっ(＾ω＾)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライヴ、握手会、ライヴ！で\nかなり盛り上がった一日でしたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなドーナツを食べて元気モリモリ(丿^ω^ヽ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/03/22/5254858/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドーナツを食べるわたしと、\nわたしを食べるせいたん（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うー、ドーナツは美味しいけどわたしは美味しくないよー(*´pq｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チャリティーライヴでは、「心の薬」「失いたくないから」「君の名は希望」の冒頭３曲をいくちゃんのピアノにのせて、合唱しました。\n白いサイリュームたちが、いつもより輝いて見えて、嬉しかったよ＾＾○°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの募金も、ご協力有難うございました。\n感謝です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの思いが届きますように ＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、そして！\nひなぴょん、お誕生日オメ！(＾ω＾)(＾ω＾)(＾ω＾)\n高校生になっても頑張ってね☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、お知らせです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊ フジテレビ「MUSIC　FAIR」\n3月23日（土）  18時00分～18時30分"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みてね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/03/22/5254858/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひょこっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばーい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん"}],"source":"archive"}